281 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (However, despite this methodology of analysis is widely use in clinical instances, according to [1], heart diseases are becoming one of the frequent causes of death in the United States. Every 33 seconds a person lose their live due to this condition and according to a clinical analysis performed in 2022, every 5 deaths, one of them is due to a heart affectation.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
