/E (Each ECG recording provided contains 12 lead, which correspond to different perspectives and combinations of the heartbeat measurements in a single sample. However, a portion of these can be redundant and dependent on other leads. Thus, as described in [7], 4 leads can be removed mainly because these are linear combination of the remaining leads, hence the information is implict already and does not provide any additional dimensionality or relevance in the analysis. )
